        "text": "Temper oil with kalo jeere and green chillies, sauté tomato quarters with turmeric, cumin, and Kashmiri chilli powder, add 1.25 cups warm water, and simmer pabda fish, fried bori, and brinjal for 4 minutes; top with chopped coriander.",
